        <mxCell id="up-failure-rule" value="进入 FAILED：&#xa;• ACCEPTED：重新校验或安装准备失败&#xa;• STOPPING 至 HEALTH_CHECKING：任一执行阶段失败&#xa;• HEALTH_CHECKING：安装状态提交失败" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2F2;strokeColor=#B85450;fontSize=10;arcSize=6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
